---
import { site } from '../data/site';
import '../styles/global.css';

const shelfMarkup = site.works;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f3eee4" />
    <meta name="description" content="Isaac Ndahura — a personal corner of the internet." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <title>Isaac Ndahura — Personal archive (review build)</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Oswald:wght@500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,500;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="site-shell">
      <header class="topbar" data-animate="enter">
        <a class="wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="Isaac Ndahura home">IN<span>.</span></a>
        <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
          {site.navigation.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
        </nav>
        <span class="header-note">PERSONAL ARCHIVE · REVIEW BUILD</span>
      </header>
      <main id="main">
        <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
          <p class="eyebrow mono" data-animate="enter">A small corner of the internet <span>·</span> Nairobi, Kenya</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero-title" data-animate="hero-title" aria-label="Isaac Ndahura"><span>Isaac</span> <span>Ndahura</span></h1>
          <div class="hero-foot" data-animate="enter">
            <div class="hero-intro"><span class="micro-label mono">A LITTLE ABOUT THIS PLACE</span><p class="review-copy">Curious about people, ideas, and making things that feel useful. This is where a few of those threads meet.</p><span class="review-tag mono">REVIEW COPY · REPLACE BEFORE LAUNCH</span></div>
            <div class="portrait-wrap"><span class="portrait-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↙</span><span class="portrait-caption">this is me</span><div class="portrait-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Neutral portrait placeholder, not a photograph">PORTRAIT<br />PLACEHOLDER</div></div>
          </div>
          <span class="hero-index mono">A PERSONAL INDEX <span>—</span> 2026</span><a class="scroll-cue mono" href="#now"><span>SCROLL A LITTLE</span><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </section>
        <section class="currently section" id="now" aria-labelledby="now-title"><div class="section-kicker mono"><span>02</span><span>A LIVING FOOTNOTE</span></div><h2 id="now-title" class="section-heading condensed">Currently</h2><p class="review-note mono">ANNOTATED PLACEHOLDER · ISAAC’S APPROVED WORDING HAS NOT BEEN SUPPLIED.</p><p class="now-copy">Right now, I’m building <em>useful things</em>, learning from the people around me, and following the questions that refuse to leave me alone.</p></section>
        <section class="fragments section" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-title"><div class="section-topline"><div class="section-kicker mono"><span>03</span><span>A LIFE, IN FRAGMENTS</span></div><p class="section-aside">A few small things, eventually.</p></div><div class="section-title-row"><h2 id="story-title" class="section-heading condensed">Bits &amp; Pieces</h2><span class="review-tag mono">LAYOUT REVIEW · NOT BIOGRAPHICAL FACTS</span></div><div class="fragment-grid">{site.fragments.map((fragment) => <article class:list={['fragment', `fragment-${fragment.layout}`]}><div class="fragment-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>IMAGE<br />PLACEHOLDER</span><i></i></div><p class="fragment-caption">{fragment.label}<small class="mono">REPLACE BEFORE LAUNCH</small></p></article>)}</div></section>
        <section class="library section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title"><div class="section-topline"><div class="section-kicker mono"><span>04</span><span>THINGS I’VE MADE</span></div><p class="section-aside">A physical shelf, not a reading list.</p></div><div class="section-title-row"><h2 id="work-title" class="section-heading condensed">The Bookshelf</h2><span class="review-tag mono">ALL ITEMS ARE NON-REAL PLACEHOLDERS · NO LINKS</span></div><p class="library-intro">Real work and its true destinations go here. For now, these spines let us tune the shelf, the movement, and how it feels to handle an object.</p><div class="library-controls mono" aria-label="Library interaction controls"><span class="library-hint">GIVE THE SHELF A LITTLE SHAKE</span><button class="shelf-shake" type="button" aria-label="Gently shake the placeholder bookshelf">SHAKE <span aria-hidden="true">↝</span></button><button class="shelf-reset" type="button">RESET SHELF</button><span class="physics-status" aria-live="polite">RESTING</span></div><div class="shelf-stage" data-shelf aria-label="Interactive bookshelf simulation. Seven placeholders, not actual projects."><div class="shelf-platform" data-shelf-row="1" aria-label="Upper shelf"></div><div class="shelf-platform shelf-platform-lower" data-shelf-row="2" aria-label="Lower shelf"></div><div class="shelf-books" role="list">{shelfMarkup.map((book) => <div class="book-body" role="listitem" data-book data-tone={book.tone} data-row={book.id <= '04' ? 'upper' : 'lower'} data-id={book.id} tabindex="0" aria-label={`${book.title}, review placeholder, drag to move`}><span class="book-spine" aria-hidden="true"><span>{book.title}</span><small>VISUAL PLACEHOLDER</small></span></div>)}</div><noscript><p class="noscript-note">The shelf remains a static, labelled visual without JavaScript.</p></noscript></div><div class="shelf-caption mono"><span>INTERACTION EXPERIMENT · NOT REAL WORK</span><span class="shelf-desktop-note">Desktop shelf remains a single coherent surface.</span><span class="shelf-mobile-note">Mobile uses two supported rows. Tap a spine to nudge.</span></div></section>
        <section class="thoughts section" id="thoughts" aria-labelledby="thoughts-title"><div class="section-topline"><div class="section-kicker mono"><span>05</span><span>NOTES FROM THE INSIDE</span></div><p class="section-aside">Words, once there are real ones.</p></div><div class="section-title-row"><h2 id="thoughts-title" class="section-heading condensed">From My Head</h2><span class="review-tag mono">REVIEW ITEMS ONLY · NOTHING LINKED</span></div><div class="writing-row" tabindex="0" aria-label="Horizontally browsable writing placeholder cards">{site.notes.map((note, index) => <article class="writing-card" data-writing-card><div class:list={['writing-art', `writing-art-${index + 1}`]} aria-hidden="true"><span>IMAGE<br />PLACEHOLDER</span><i></i></div><div class="writing-meta mono">{note.date} <span>· {note.id}</span></div><h3>{note.title}</h3><p>Placeholder copy for evaluating the image-to-title relationship. No article exists here.</p></article>)}</div><div class="row-hint mono"><span>ON A SMALL SCREEN, SCROLL THE ROW</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div></section>
        <section class="closing section" id="hello" aria-labelledby="hello-title"><div class="section-kicker mono"><span>06</span><span>A SMALL INVITATION</span></div><h2 id="hello-title" class="closing-title">Something on your mind?</h2><p class="closing-copy">The right words—and a real way to reach me—will go here.</p><span class="review-tag mono">CONTACT PLACEHOLDER · NONFUNCTIONAL</span><div class="closing-mark" aria-hidden="true">IN<span>.</span></div></section>
      </main>
      <footer class="footer mono"><span>MADE SLOWLY, WITH CURIOSITY.</span><span>NAIROBI · © 2026</span></footer>
    </div>
    <script>import '../scripts/main.js';</script>
  </body>
</html>
